===Etymology===
{{multiple images
|direction = vertical
|image1 = A Tanzanite gemcutter brings out the sparkle in the stone.jpg
|caption1 = A [[Tanzanian#Adjective|Tanzanian]] lapidary ''(noun {{senseno|en|person}})'' [[work#Verb|working]] on [[tanzanite]].
|image2 = Fotothek df tg 0004965 Bergbau ^ Geologie ^ Gestein ^ Schmuck ^ Ring.jpg
